works_end_to_end:
The lesson Desk under the Kaksha skin (src/child/lesson/LessonScreen.tsx → src/ui-v3/kaksha/lesson/KakshaLesson.tsx → Desk.tsx with data-skin and desk.kaksha.css):
- top bar: Pause, title, phase line, CC, More;
- the teacher window with the AI label, and the pinned Question card with Hear;
- the Work tray (Studio board, module or game) and the Answer dock (Talk / Type / Number pad / Hint);
- the Pause / End / Help / Hint sheets, trouble strips, and resume by lesson id;
- the intake card for the session-first cohort (IntakeCard.tsx ← server/director/state.js intakeUi);
- the Briefing with hold-to-launch before Antariksh (ui-v3/kaksha/play/Briefing.tsx);
- the Debrief at the end: What you did, Now secure with the earned moment, Opened, Next (ui-v3/kaksha/lesson/Debrief.tsx).

Parent corner at /parent/* (src/parent/index.tsx, Shell.tsx, Gate.tsx), in Volt calm:
- the PIN gate and Home (This week, Try at home, Next lesson, Made for);
- Progress with the evidence sheet;
- Lessons and the lesson card, with a PIN-gated transcript for class ≤ 4;
- Notes with Listen;
- Controls: limit, hours, Open now, language, address, Tap and type only, Homework today, Test window, weekly letter;
- Children; Data (consents, memory list with delete, export, delete account); Help; Change PIN.

